ch observation covering all matches where the pair encountered each other", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["unit of analysis"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 34, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[51, 51]], "note": "sample size subheading"}, {"id": 35, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[52, 58]], "assertion": "the analytic sample comprised 106,803 dyads (89,535 light-skin, 17,268 dark-skin), 1,339 unique players, 2,816 unique referees, and 1,341 red card events (1.26%)", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["sample size"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 36, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[59, 59]], "note": "exposure definition subheading"}, {"id": 37, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[60, 60]], "assertion": "skin tone was measured by two independent raters scoring photos on a 5-point scale, and the average rating was used to define exposure groups", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone", "raters"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [38]}, {"id": 38, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[60, 60]], "assertion": "the two ratings showed high inter-rater reliability (r=0.923)", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["inter-rater reliability"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [37]}, {"id": 39, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[61, 62]], "assertion": "light skin was defined as average rating 0-0.25 and dark skin as 0.75-1.0", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone groups"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 40, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[63, 64]], "assertion": "medium skin tones (0.375-0.625) were excluded from the primary analysis to create a clear contrast between groups", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["medium skin tone dyads"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 41, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[65, 65]], "note": "outcome definition subheading"}, {"id": 42, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[66, 67]], "assertion": "the outcome was defined as any red card received by the player from the referee across all encounters, coded binary", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["outcome variable"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 43, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[68, 68]], "note": "statistical method subheading"}, {"id": 44, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[69, 70]], "assertion": "used logistic regression with marginal effects to estimate the adjusted risk difference, with cluster-robust SEs at the player level", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["statistical model"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [45]}, {"id": 45, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[69, 70]], "assertion": "used bootstrap confidence intervals (500 iterations, clustered by player) for inference", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["bootstrap CI"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [44]}, {"id": 46, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[71, 71]], "note": "covariates subheading"}, {"id": 47, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[72, 73]], "assertion": "the model was adjusted for a set of listed confounders", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["covariates"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 48, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[74, 74]], "assertion": "games played (continuous) was included as a covariate to account for exposure time", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["games played"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 49, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[75, 76]], "assertion": "player position (categorical, defender as reference) was included as a covariate", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["player position"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 50, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[77, 78]], "assertion": "league country (categorical, England as reference) was included as a covariate", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["league country"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 51, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[79, 79]], "assertion": "player height (continuous, cm) was included as a covariate", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["player height"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 52, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[80, 81]], "assertion": "referee country implicit bias (meanIAT from Project Implicit) was included as a covariate", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["referee implicit bias"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 53, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[82, 82]], "note": "rationale subheading"}, {"id": 54, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[83, 83]], "assertion": "games, position, league, and height were selected as potential confounders because they may differ between skin tone groups and independently affect red card risk", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["covariate rationale"], "confidence": "low", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 55, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[84, 84]], "assertion": "referee country bias was included as a key potential confounder given the hypothesis", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["referee bias"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 56, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[85, 85]], "assertion": "weight was excluded from the model due to high collinearity with height (r=0.79)", "polarity": "did_not", "targets": ["weight"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 57, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[86, 86]], "assertion": "yellow cards were not included in the primary model because they may be a mediator rather than a confounder", "polarity": "did_not", "targets": ["yellow cards"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 58, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[87, 88]], "assertion": "player-level and referee-level clustering was addressed through cluster-robust standard errors", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["clustering"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 59, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[89, 89]], "note": "exclusions subheading"}, {"id": 60, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[90, 